,"Id":285116,"Name":"Jenessa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79660,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0372158b2ff857754d2d5daca7a50e5e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Jenessa\" post=\"1906470\" timestamp=\"1445169277\"]\nHey! everyone i&#039;m getting married next month on 30th Nov in qatar, currently m living in Dubai, looking for wedding organizer in qatar also a florist! So guys please suggest, Should i order bulk roses online from here   [color=#1155cc][font=arial][size=2][url=\"http:\/\/www.flowersnext.com\/florist\/qatar\/\"]http:\/\/www.flowersnext.com\/florist\/qatar\/[\/url][\/size][\/font][\/color]? or look for event planner &amp;amp; decorator in Qatar? m confused! plzz help me out with this![\/quote]Hey @[member=\"Jenessa\"],\n\nI would advice to get a wedding organizer on board, especially since you are planning from afar.  They can source some good florist that could work with your budget.\n\nHappyPlanning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1906701,"PostDate":1445450685,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Jenessa, on 18 October 2015 - 06:54 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey! everyone i'm getting married next month on 30th Nov in qatar, currently m living in Dubai, looking for wedding organizer in qatar also a florist! So guys please suggest, Should i order bulk roses online from here \u00a0 <span  style=\"font-size:90%;font-family:arial, sans, sans-serif;color:#1155cc\"><a href='http:\/\/www.flowersnext.com\/florist\/qatar\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.flowersne...\/florist\/qatar\/<\/a><\/span>? or look for event planner & decorator in Qatar? m confused! plzz help me out with this!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285116\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285116-jenessa\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jenessa<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would advice to get a wedding organizer on board, especially since you are planning from afar. \u00a0They can source some good florist that could work with your budget.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>HappyPlanning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79660","Title":"Should I Order Flowers Online Or Look For A Local Florist!","LastPostDate":1445450685},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}